{"id": "81a5d0f8-1180-434a-8035-8903a5f576d8", "slug": "magnetic-features", "title": "Magnetic Features", "description": "Magnetic Features Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Magnetic Features\"\ndescription: \"Magnetic Features Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#38BDF8\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#38BDF8\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Magnetic Features\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 5; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, interactive, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nMagnetic Features Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nInteractive Topology A dynamic ecosystem of features that intuitively responds to intent. Explore the map to see the neural routing in action. Core Router The central brain orchestrating sync across all edge nodes. Inst…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Interactive Topology; Core Router; Instant Relays; Secure Vault; Distributed State; Live Telemetry.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #38BDF8, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #38BDF8, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Magnetic Features</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-neutral-950 text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-screen py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n\n        <!-- Container Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 z-0\">\n            <!-- Line 1 -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Line 2 -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03] hidden md:block\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Line 3 -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03] hidden md:block\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Line 4 -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-500\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section Header -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 text-center mb-16 px-4 w-full\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-4\">Interactive Topology</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-neutral-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base\">A dynamic ecosystem of features that intuitively responds to intent. Explore the map to see the neural routing in action.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Magnetic Interactive Area -->\n        <div id=\"magnetic-area\" class=\"relative w-full h-[500px] md:h-[700px] max-w-5xl mx-auto overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] shadow-2xl z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Connection Lines -->\n            <svg id=\"connections-svg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\">\n                <line class=\"connection-line transition-colors duration-300\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                <line class=\"connection-line transition-colors duration-300\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                <line class=\"connection-line transition-colors duration-300\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                <line class=\"connection-line transition-colors duration-300\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n            </svg>\n\n            <!-- Center Card (Core) -->\n            <div class=\"magnetic-card absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-48 md:w-64 p-5 md:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center text-center z-10 select-none cursor-default transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 md:mb-4 border border-cyan-500/20\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-cyan-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-1 md:mb-2\">Core Router</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">The central brain orchestrating sync across all edge nodes.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Orbit Cards -->\n            <!-- Top Left -->\n            <div class=\"magnetic-card absolute top-[15%] left-[25%] md:top-[22%] md:left-[22%] w-40 md:w-56 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-start z-10 select-none cursor-default transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-fuchsia-400 mb-2 md:mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-1\">Instant Relays</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Low-latency event processing.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Right -->\n            <div class=\"magnetic-card absolute top-[20%] left-[75%] md:top-[25%] md:left-[78%] w-40 md:w-56 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-start z-10 select-none cursor-default transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-emerald-400 mb-2 md:mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-1\">Secure Vault</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">End-to-end payload encryption.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Left -->\n            <div class=\"magnetic-card absolute top-[80%] left-[25%] md:top-[75%] md:left-[28%] w-40 md:w-56 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-start z-10 select-none cursor-default transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-blue-400 mb-2 md:mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-1\">Distributed State</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Multi-region consistency.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right -->\n            <div class=\"magnetic-card absolute top-[75%] left-[75%] md:top-[72%] md:left-[75%] w-40 md:w-56 p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-start z-10 select-none cursor-default transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-purple-400 mb-2 md:mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-1\">Live Telemetry</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Rich analytics and deep tracing.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const area = document.getElementById('magnetic-area');\n            const cards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.magnetic-card'));\n            const lines = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.connection-line'));\n\n            // Connect center card (0) to all other orbit cards (1-4)\n            const connections = [[0, 1], [0, 2], [0, 3], [0, 4]];\n\n            let mouseX = -1000;\n            let mouseY = -1000;\n            let isHovering = false;\n\n            // Track mouse inside the container\n            area.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = area.getBoundingClientRect();\n                mouseX = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                mouseY = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                isHovering = true;\n            });\n\n            area.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                isHovering = false;\n            });\n\n            // Initialize or update base positions of cards (handling responsive resizes safely)\n            function initPositions() {\n                cards.forEach(card => {\n                    card.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%)'; // Reset to pure CSS position\n                    card.initData = {\n                        x: card.offsetLeft,\n                        y: card.offsetTop,\n                        currX: 0,\n                        currY: 0\n                    };\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Small delay to ensure CSS has painted layout before grabbing offsets\n            setTimeout(initPositions, 50);\n            window.addEventListener('resize', initPositions);\n\n            // Animation loop for magnetic pull, repulsion, and connection lines\n            function render() {\n                if(!cards[0].initData) {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                cards.forEach((card, i) => {\n                    let targetX = 0;\n                    let targetY = 0;\n                    let isGlowing = false;\n\n                    if (isHovering) {\n                        let dx = mouseX - card.initData.x;\n                        let dy = mouseY - card.initData.y;\n                        let dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        // Pull towards cursor when nearby\n                        if (dist < 300) {\n                            targetX = dx * 0.12;\n                            targetY = dy * 0.12;\n                            isGlowing = true;\n\n                            let intensity = 1 - (dist / 300);\n                            card.style.boxShadow = `0 0 ${40 * intensity}px rgba(56, 189, 248, ${0.1 * intensity}), inset 0 0 ${20 * intensity}px rgba(56, 189, 248, ${0.15 * intensity})`;\n                            card.style.borderColor = `rgba(56, 189, 248, ${0.5 * intensity})`;\n                        } else {\n                            card.style.boxShadow = 'none';\n                            card.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)';\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        card.style.boxShadow = 'none';\n                        card.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)';\n                    }\n\n                    // Push cards away from each other subtly\n                    cards.forEach((otherCard, j) => {\n                        if (i !== j && isHovering) {\n                            let rdx = (card.initData.x + targetX) - (otherCard.initData.x + otherCard.initData.currX);\n                            let rdy = (card.initData.y + targetY) - (otherCard.initData.y + otherCard.initData.currY);\n                            let rDist = Math.sqrt(rdx * rdx + rdy * rdy);\n\n                            if (rDist < 180 && rDist > 0) {\n                                let force = (180 - rDist) / 180;\n                                targetX += (rdx / rDist) * force * 25;\n                                targetY += (rdy / rDist) * force * 25;\n                            }\n                        }\n                    });\n\n                    // Smooth easing back to alignment or towards targets\n                    card.initData.currX += (targetX - card.initData.currX) * 0.08;\n                    card.initData.currY += (targetY - card.initData.currY) * 0.08;\n\n                    card.style.transform = `translate(calc(-50% + ${card.initData.currX}px), calc(-50% + ${card.initData.currY}px))`;\n                    card.isGlowing = isGlowing;\n                });\n\n                // Update SVG connection lines dynamically\n                connections.forEach((conn, i) => {\n                    const c1 = cards[conn[0]];\n                    const c2 = cards[conn[1]];\n                    const line = lines[i];\n\n                    line.setAttribute('x1', c1.initData.x + c1.initData.currX);\n                    line.setAttribute('y1', c1.initData.y + c1.initData.currY);\n                    line.setAttribute('x2', c2.initData.x + c2.initData.currX);\n                    line.setAttribute('y2', c2.initData.y + c2.initData.currY);\n\n                    // Illuminate line if connected to an active node\n                    if (c1.isGlowing || c2.isGlowing) {\n                        line.setAttribute('stroke', 'rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4)');\n                    } else {\n                        line.setAttribute('stroke', 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)');\n                    }\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            }\n\n            render();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "magnetic-features.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/magnetic-features.jpg", "source_name": "magnetic-features-DESIGN.md", "views": 45, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T15:30:02.760188+00:00"}